#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:25 06bf69c6c04345acb7e613cdc081a9e3
#: 0ed35e7feca242ec8ff0779b3af032ce 1c769e7ecfc2424b8e976c31c1b3d300
#: 99641ecc288447a18fd943814f95ef29 adfea86031cf477db36cbdcecd62655a
#: b6ae35d22fed42c6955e5185e9e7e430 b96ee50fa0224466af035a917387f7fd
msgid "ArduPilot Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "ArduPilot 连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:27 02a8463f2928476b9221e4e6e48f4126
#: 1c7eb043975b4a92bb50fc94b41c08c9 1ea62550c8e449eab8b8240625072200
#: 4a738836ddf74856b0c48ccdf3fc9711 7d799bcceba34ce6829622f7c4acf1f7
#: b457a836b6b34f0395961351aca71631 b68c4ccf38044ed79c8db1e372e813bd
msgid ""
"The ESCs should be connected to the autopilot's CAN port.  Below shows the "
"ESCs connected to the autopilot's CAN1 port but CAN2 may also be used.  The "
"ESC furthest from the autopilot's CAN port should have a CAN bus terminator "
"connecting the CAN_L and CAN_H pins.  The VimDrones ESC shown includes a "
"solder pad for this purpose."
msgstr ""
"ESC 应连接到飞控的 CAN 端口。以下示例显示 ESC 连接到飞控的 CAN1 端口，也可使用 CAN2。距飞控 CAN 端口最远的 ESC 应安装"
" CAN 总线终端电阻，连接 CAN_L 和 CAN_H 引脚。图示的 VimDrones ESC 为此提供了焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:32 1e17cbc4dea44ca6b8286b2a8b3b58d9
#: 493848bce5474e96b2f221c028d0ce26 78244787ae314eb4923b696ac1413f1e
#: 7e57d9dced514db6a06a6ffc60941075 a66f32eaed854ff88c16ca437e298ca3
#: aebdbfb259fc4551b7b6752a9f5b0351 b8f2a33cb9a04a938d9871f71a35d034
msgid ""
"To enable communication with the AM32 ESCs using DroneCAN, set the following"
" parameters:"
msgstr "要通过 DroneCAN 与 AM32 ESC 通信，请设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:34 0a82b255247f44ef9815fba1f0d26851
#: 73f899572b884d6ab8071b5e5be98f59 be7dff0fc1fd434c874e5cb715159556
#: bf698d7137b54c03979cb39ccd546db4 c5b3aa2358334f249b22127c3debf8e6
#: cd8561b90c9c4f5db3f654faa47f9c9c ea20324bc2a44db8a16deb7bc28901fb
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver) to specify that "
"the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动器），以指定 ESC 连接到 CAN1 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:35 5a0ab0cb18754c9684319b57e28a3314
#: 60db4df5d2aa4179b62733100746a3eb 692599b6c5f34efb88a8031428ce44b1
#: 7d2cff634d3648c0a57ac32a8f124af2 e80112d032ab4d1bbb6c78e693a9909d
#: f0817f46ac7e4ac786322a5e05ca82bc f300d5970ddd4ca3810fbfb238e6269d
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:37 35eca797fd11460987204ed72617e1df
#: 5cea5206234e45c7a7982509eb031991 80edeae927dc4d8a9fb6bf6ca6bf2e3e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 and :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000 so ArduPilot uses an output range that matches the "
"ESCs input range"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 以及 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000，使 ArduPilot 使用与 ESC 输入范围匹配的输出范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:38
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:40 068cd1ca93ca47758fe7e91077facf18
#: 248819337dbc4c0b96f52f67a6468482 263b897c172d43d6907e5d299e5f3272
#: 383d7171ec8d48e7aa55020b92228715 46292632fbb44f2eb7b1df66ec30c1bd
#: adc963dde23d41d4a4a40ecd6f68ab74 d393983cea5c4002a92bdfa5839f5b8a
msgid ""
"Set ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to each motor channel (e.g. 33 - 40 for motors 1 - "
"8). This is automatically configured when setting frame class/type. If a "
"motor channel isn't assigned to a servo output, commands won't be sent to "
"the associated ESC."
msgstr ""
"把 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设到各电机通道（如电机 1 - 8 对应 33 - "
"40）。设置机架类别/类型时会自动完成此配置。如果某个电机通道未分配到舵机输出，命令就不会发送到对应的 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:39
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:41 22f12d90c4d4456f99f0cf51a7ef7265
#: 3bd650a986324fd8bb22b2a95a69033c 51b0bc39688e48309a8a2d23286d659d
#: 7fd06bfae4ca4b619bf373124457438f 9ae9951788a94e178ce69731511f82fc
#: c6ca33e5d1fa49c5b8969c0824efafc6 ed1ce2a711c94057bc96386f5585ffbd
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` is a bitmask that determines "
"which servo output channels are transmitted over CAN.  For quadcopters this "
"is normally \"15\""
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` 是一个位掩码，决定哪些舵机输出通道通过 CAN "
"传输。对于四轴飞行器，通常为 `15`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:40
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:42 1a8e15bdb9dd4e24a934f51cae91e97a
#: 6722d56a3f1142bab1834bdaaf00553d 9448341c8eca4f63ba624d4882d9b610
#: 9571090c6a954218bbdd444af5a11d30 ba36791e77804c36be55ab2b6cf15989
#: d3de61983246420fa86a811f6dbed10b e2d6bcdc401f48a195c9e8cfa677a09f
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF>` allows for more efficient packing"
" of ESC command messages when ESCs are connected to higher servo outputs "
"(e.g. 5 to 8).  For most vehicles this can be left at zero"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF <CAN_D1_UC_ESC_OF>` 在 ESC 连接到较高舵机输出（如 5~8）时，允许更高效地打包 "
"ESC 指令消息。大多数飞行器可保持默认值零"

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:41
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:43 06557fb7f5334bae96b87f5ea05d9d38
#: 1198cd0a6a40416585c51a5c17861c74 1b8eb42ebd044e3eb1bd7c45598209c8
